    "title": "\"I've never seen him have a bad day,\" Spencer Campbell, GJ's biggest sports fan, is one of one - NewsBreak",
    "text": "GRAND JUNCTION, Colo. ( KREX ) — If you’ve been to a sporting event in the Grand Valley, you’ve likely seen the loud, always happy, always smiling Spencer Campbell rooting on Grand Junction’s home teams. He’s a beam of light for everyone. He brings endless joy every single day. He’s never had a bad day. At long last, I (Big Will) properly highlight one of the most special people I’ve ever met. Someone who makes each and every single person he meets feel like the most important person in the world. Join me as I follow Spencer throughout his many nightly Jackalope-game duties and speak to the people around the team about how he touches lives every night at the ballpark. Spencer Campbell is one of one. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WesternSlopeNow.com.",
